{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21620","headline":"鄂州寓馆严涧宅 · 元稹","name":"鄂州寓馆严涧宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤有高梧鹤有松，偶来江外寄行踪。\n花枝满院空啼鸟，尘榻无人忆卧龙。\n心想夜闲唯足梦，眼看春尽不相逢。\n何时最是思君处，月入斜窗晓寺钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}